<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For me Thy body Thou didst give,</l><l>That I may ever share in Thee;</l><l>For me Thy precious blood was shed,</l><l>That from my sins I might be free.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>By resurrection Thou didst change</l><l>Thy form and as the Spirit come;</l><l>Thou wouldst that I be filled with Thee</l><l>That all Thy riches mine become.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now as the symbols we behold,</l><l>Thy loving self we see anew;</l><l>We thank Thee for Thy heart’s desire</l><l>As all Thy travail we review.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We eat the bread and drink the wine,</l><l>And to Thy sweetness we are led;</l><l>In spirit each receiving Thee,</l><l>Our spirits with Thyself are fed.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>We long to eat and drink e’en more,</l><l>To take Thyself in spirit thus,</l><l>Till Thou shalt all our being fill</l><l>And true remembrance have from us.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
